//RS //! The typed export shapes shared by native Library and sandbox outputs.
//RS //!
//RS //! Artifact emission consumes the selected checked MIR plan and its export
//RS //! rows. Each row references a `MirFunction`; the function row supplies the
//RS //! scalar/component signature and access modes while the plan supplies the
//RS //! external symbol. This module has no source-AST ingress or backend policy
//RS //! selection.
